{
  "_comment": [
    "Candidate IKEA article numbers for the Furn-App catalogue.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE: every article number here was observed in a live IKEA search",
    "result during research. 'observed_on' names the market whose URL appeared",
    "(sa = confirmed on the Saudi site). IKEA article numbers are global - the",
    "MALM high bed frame is s09929373 on /sa/, /kw/ and /se/ alike - so an",
    "article seen on another market is a valid CANDIDATE for KSA.",
    "",
    "THIS FILE ASSERTS NOTHING ABOUT KSA AVAILABILITY, PRICE, OR DIMENSIONS.",
    "The pipeline resolves each URL against /sa/en/, follows redirects to the",
    "canonical slug, and drops anything that 404s or lacks measurements.",
    "",
    "CORRECTION (after the first live run): slugs differ per market (US 'gray'",
    "vs SA 'grey'), and IKEA KSA does NOT resolve by article number when the",
    "slug disagrees - it returns 404. 47 of these seeds fell out that way.",
    "Discovery therefore runs off IKEA's search backend, which answers with the",
    "canonical /sa/en/ URL for this market; these seeds are now a fallback for",
    "when that API is unreachable, and are resolved through the API index first.",
    "",
    "'dimensions_hint' is a cross-check only - never emitted into the catalogue."
  ],
